   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "excerpt",
   "volumeId": "frus1877",
   "documentId": "d222",
   "text": "In the present case it waits before recognizing General Diaz as the President of Mexico until it shall be assured that his election is approved by the Mexican people, and that his administration is possessed of stability to endure and of disposition to comply with the rules of international comity and the obligations of treaties."
  },
  {
   "kind": "document",
   "volumeId": "frus1878",
   "documentId": "d344",
   "notes": [
